gQM(){return"Is it possible for an ordinary passenger car to drive along the bus lane along the road?"},
gQL(){return"No. Regular cars are prohibited from driving in the lane. Changing lanes for a turn, entering and disembarking with intermittent markings are certain exceptions."},
gQO(){return"Does the left arrow from the leftmost lane also allow for a U-turn?"},
